# Browser extension (Page Chat)

- Manifest: @extension/manifest.json (MV3). Load unpacked from `extension/` after build.
- Source: @src/extension/content.ts injects toggle + iframe; @src/extension/panel.tsx renders `ChatApp`.
- Room id: @src/extension/roomId.ts — `hostname + pathname`, normalised via `normalizeRoomId()`.
- Helpers: @src/extension/contentHelpers.ts — injectable page check, panel URL, SPA history wrapping.
- Backend host baked at build: `CHAT_HOST` env → `__CHAT_HOST__` in @src/extension/config.ts via esbuild `--define`.
- Builds: `bun run build:extension` (dev, may include localhost); `bun run build:extension:store` (store ZIP).
- Iframe uses extension origin to avoid page CSP issues on WebSockets.
- Store publishing checklist: @extension/STORE.md.
- Tests: @src/extension/roomId.test.ts, @src/extension/contentHelpers.test.ts.
